 * @param channel The channel ID to read.
 * @param value Pointer to store the read value.
 *
 * @retval 0 If successful.
 * @retval -EINVAL If parameters are invalid (e.g., NULL value pointer,
 *                 invalid channel).
 * @retval -ENXIO If the channel is not configured.
 */
